# Game Systems

- Keep game rules in `src/systems/` as pure functions
- Zustand store holds state; components only render
- Port behavior from `rugby-game/rugby-game.html` when in doubt
- Do not put combat or win logic inside R3F components

## Drone feel

Forward (W / ArrowUp) and altitude (R / F) must **ease**, not snap. Tune `DRONE_THRUST`, `DRONE_ALTITUDE_THRUST`, `DRONE_MAX_SPEED`, and `DRONE_MAX_VERTICAL_SPEED` in `src/constants/game.ts`. Vertical speed is capped separately — do not reuse the huge horizontal thrust on F/R.

## FPV ram

Pigs (including red-tinted pig meshes) die from rugby explosions **and** from the drone hitting their body (`RAM_HORIZ` + altitude overlap). A ram runs `checkExplosion` at the pig and applies `RAM_DAMAGE` to the drone. Do not require `soldier.pig === true` — level 1 reds use the same model.
